### 查询供货源
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/supply-sources/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","pageSize":10}

### 创建供货源
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/supply-sources/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"supplySourceCode":"warehouse-01","alias":"Warehouse 01","address":{"name":"Warehouse","addressLine1":"1 Main St","city":"Seattle","state":"WA","postalCode":"98101","countryCode":"US"}}}

### 查询、更新、归档和更新状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/supply-sources/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","supplySourceId":"amzn1.supply-source.example"}

### 更新供货源
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/supply-sources/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","supplySourceId":"amzn1.supply-source.example","body":{"alias":"Warehouse 01"}}

### 归档供货源
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/supply-sources/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","supplySourceId":"amzn1.supply-source.example"}

### 更新供货源状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/supply-sources/status/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","supplySourceId":"amzn1.supply-source.example","body":{"status":"ACTIVE"}}
